![CleanShot 2025-02-11 at 15 48 40@2x](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f45843bf-863e-4a6e-8872-95f5ad4769dd)

Wow `base?.[base.length - 1]` is fast! However, I think there is a slight difference. So `base?.at(-1)` is okay since it is 10 characters short (without minifying).

